        "content": "<p>I'd like to modify <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Mathlib.TacticAnalysis.mergeWithGrind#doc\">docs#Mathlib.TacticAnalysis.mergeWithGrind</a> to provide a TryThis suggestion, which does a replacement from <code>tac; grind</code> to just <code>grind</code>. What is the right way to do this? I came up with something like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TacticAnalysis</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TryThis</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mergeWithGrindAllowed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`«</span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">adaptation_note_</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- just the end is different here...</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TacticAnalysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mergeWithGrind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TacticAnalysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">preI</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">postI</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">seq</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">seq</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">:]</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toArray</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">postI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``Lean.Parser.Tactic.grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;&amp;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"n\">preI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∉</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mergeWithGrindAllowed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">goalsBefore</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">preI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">runTacticCode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">postI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"n\">catch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goals</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isEmpty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"c1\">-- the part I added...</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getPos?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">canonicalOnly</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">postI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getTailPos?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">canonicalOnly</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Syntax</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">setInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SourceInfo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">synthetic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tacI</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Command</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">liftCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TryThis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addSuggestion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>but had no sense of how hacky this is.</p>",
